// LIQUIDATED loss-cut Easter egg (Kurumi's forced-loss-cut beat, RB
// version — with Bo's OWN art, animated). A 120vh overscroll zone past
// the loop band drives a scroll-depth fade — dark navy + grid, then
// full black that holds — and one more scroll cuts in a ~3s splash:
// Bo's blue-and-orange black-hole vortex full-bleed, Bo himself
// falling through it in his black Nike Tech tracksuit, the big
// LIQUIDATED stamp as live outlined text across the lower half, dark
// vignettes framing top and bottom. While the splash holds, Bo falls
// a little (ease-in drift down, slight turn, subtle scale) and the
// vortex turns very slowly behind him. Then the page snaps back to
// the hero. Replays every time. Fade depth is driven by scroll
// distance, never a timer. Skipped entirely under reduced motion
// (see HomeScripts). Art: Bo's own bo-vortex.jpg + the 1024px HD
// falling-Bo cutout, as WebP.
---

<div class="b-loss-zone" id="bLossZone" aria-hidden="true"></div>
<div class="b-loss-veil" id="bLossVeil" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="b-loss-navy" id="bLossNavy"></div>
  <div class="b-loss-black" id="bLossBlack"></div>
</div>
<div
  class="b-loss-splash"
  id="bLossSplash"
  role="img"
  aria-label="RetailBo — liquidated. Bo falling through a blue and orange black-hole vortex in a black tracksuit, phones and candlestick chart screens floating around him, over a large LIQUIDATED stamp."
>
  <img class="b-loss-bg" src="/assets/bo-vortex.webp" alt="" aria-hidden="true" />
  <img class="b-loss-bo" src="/assets/bo-falling.webp" alt="" aria-hidden="true" />
  <div class="b-loss-stamp" aria-hidden="true">LIQUIDATED</div>
  <div class="b-loss-vig t" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="b-loss-vig b" aria-hidden="true"></div>
</div>
